  shape: class
  # expec-uml: 
  "construction(feedback, sources)": ""
  # expec-uml: 
  "configurationChanged(configuration)": ""
  "Promises · configurationChanged": ""
  "configurationChanged · 1": "Receive the current selected saved configuration snapshot or"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 2": "absence. Validate its supplied text through the public"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 3": "ConfigurationReader with shipped output profiles, then"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 4": "capture only validated Configuration.packages aliases and"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 5": "phases as the existing SourceComposer's DependencyPackage"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 6": "inputs. Missing text, invalid configuration, switching"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 7": "manifests or withdrawing selection replaces the prior"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 8": "catalog; never retain old supplied packages after an invalid"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 9": "or absent snapshot. Do not use writable as package"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 10": "availability or read unsaved configuration buffers;"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 11": "ConnectionSidebar supplies its actual saved-text policy."
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 12": "These are supplied compiler configuration facts, not proof"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 13": "of package installation, native exports, external"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 14": "declaration models, runtime behavior or generation"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 15": "readiness. Keep genuinely unsupplied aliases and missing"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 16": "phases as the language's actual findings. Do not infer"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 17": "packages from imports, folder names, node_modules or another"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 18": "project."
  "configurationChanged · 2": "A changed catalog invalidates current open analyses and"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 2": "republishes their exact retained unsaved sources at"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 3": "unchanged editor versions through the same SourceComposer,"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 4": "Compiler and Inspection/Resolution publication. Reuse"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 5": "unchanged parsed sources and saved dependency snapshots."
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 6": "Retain the validated catalog for ordinary source edits"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 7": "rather than revalidating configuration per edit. Preserve"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 8": "current document lifetimes and guard reentrant"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 9": "source/configuration/feedback changes so older work cannot"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 10": "publish with an obsolete catalog. Validation or publication"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 11": "exceptions surface; they are not empty success. Existing"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 12": "configuration consumers retain actual validation"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 13": "explanations. This operation never acquires project/package"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 14": "code, scans, installs, generates, saves or writes; it does"
  "configurationChanged · 2 · 15": "not require connected-target verification."
  "configurationChanged · 3": "Retain the validated requirements metadata with the same"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 2": "catalog, and include the selected manifest filename and"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 3": "effective scope metadata in configuration currentness even"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 4": "when aliases/phases are unchanged. Prepare requirementsFor"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 5": "over the actual captured workspace source identities and"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 6": "provider-supplied local paths; no resolver, synthetic model"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 7": "or implicit runtime imports are added. Project obligations"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 8": "apply to supplied workspace sources even when a foreign or"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 9": "untitled source has no local path; folder/exact-file"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 10": "obligations require verified local paths. Do not treat"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 11": "acquired external declaration models as workspace sources."
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 12": "Invalid or absent configuration withdraws earlier"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 13": "rows/catalog and publishes the actual configuration"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 14": "findings; failed scope preparation publishes no old rows. A"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 15": "relevant saved scope change rechecks retained unsaved text"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 16": "at the same editor version. Cache source ownership between"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 17": "text edits; invalidate it after a selected configuration"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 18": "change or relevant source-route notification, guard"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 19": "reentrant provider/feedback callbacks, and never run"
  "configurationChanged · 3 · 20": "SourceLoader or connected native capture on each keystroke."
  # expec-uml: 
  "opened(source, version)": ""
  "Promises · opened": ""
  "opened · 1": "Start an open document lifetime from this exact supplied"
  "opened · 1 · 2": "snapshot. Use one retained LangiumReader and Compiler;"
  "opened · 1 · 3": "compose accepted source models through the existing"
  "opened · 1 · 4": "SourceComposer. Resolve authored source locators relative to"
  "opened · 1 · 5": "their owner URI and obtain only required source snapshots"
  "opened · 1 · 6": "through DocumentSources. Absolute URIs remain usable; a"
  "opened · 1 · 7": "relative locator without a hierarchical owner, including"
  "opened · 1 · 8": "untitled, remains an unavailable-module finding without"
  "opened · 1 · 9": "guessing a workspace or throwing a URL-base error. Open"
  "opened · 1 · 10": "unsaved text overrides saved text. Cache parsing by exact"
  "opened · 1 · 11": "text, including rejected text; never reuse a previous"
  "opened · 1 · 12": "accepted model after invalid edits. Publish real syntax and"
  "opened · 1 · 13": "compiler findings without generating, installing packages or"
  "opened · 1 · 14": "requiring a project connection. No runtime package facts are"
  "opened · 1 · 15": "invented; unavailable prerequisites remain explicit. Treat"
  "opened · 1 · 16": "URIs as identity. Reject invalid noninteger or negative"
  "opened · 1 · 17": "versions with RangeError before changing state."
  # expec-uml: 
  "changed(source, version)": ""
  "Promises · changed": ""
  "changed · 1": "Reject a noninteger or negative version with a RangeError"
  "changed · 1 · 2": "before changing state. For an open document, check and"
  "changed · 1 · 3": "publish only a strictly newer version. Ignore duplicate,"
  "changed · 1 · 4": "older and unopened-document changes. Retain the exact"
  "changed · 1 · 5": "snapshot and version for publication. Update affected open"
  "changed · 1 · 6": "dependents as well. Check that the same lifetime, version"
  "changed · 1 · 7": "and dependency revision remain current before publishing"
  "changed · 1 · 8": "after reentrant source or feedback callbacks. The native"
  "changed · 1 · 9": "caller excludes callbacks from an earlier document lifetime;"
  "changed · 1 · 10": "URI/version alone cannot distinguish those after reopening."
  "changed · 1 · 11": "Syntax acceptance makes no semantic validity claim; retain"
  "changed · 1 · 12": "compiler problems and deferred requirements. Reader or"
  "changed · 1 · 13": "publication exceptions must surface rather than masquerade"
  "changed · 1 · 14": "as an empty successful result."
  # expec-uml: 
  "closed(uri)": ""
  "Promises · closed": ""
  "closed · 1": "End this open lifetime and clear its diagnostics. Ignore"
  "closed · 1 · 2": "later changes until the document is opened again; reopening"
  "closed · 1 · 3": "may start with a lower version. Repeated close is harmless."
  "closed · 1 · 4": "Imported closed documents fall back to current saved text,"
  "closed · 1 · 5": "and affected open dependents are rechecked. Unrelated"
  "closed · 1 · 6": "documents remain unchanged."
  # expec-uml: 
  "sourceChanged(uri)": ""
  "Promises · sourceChanged": ""
  "sourceChanged · 1": "Invalidate a requested saved source after creation, change"
  "sourceChanged · 1 · 2": "or deletion and recheck affected open entries even when"
  "sourceChanged · 1 · 3": "their editor version is unchanged. Ignore unrelated URIs and"
  "sourceChanged · 1 · 4": "saved changes hidden by an authoritative open snapshot."
  "sourceChanged · 1 · 5": "Reuse unchanged parsed snapshots and read only the"
  "sourceChanged · 1 · 6": "invalidated source plus newly required imports. Track"
  "sourceChanged · 1 · 7": "missing imports too, and terminate cyclic import"
  "sourceChanged · 1 · 8": "acquisition. Preserve other documents and previous reports;"
  "sourceChanged · 1 · 9": "do not let reentrant older work replace current feedback."
  "sourceChanged · 2": "When folder/file scopes are in use, a relevant file-route"
  "sourceChanged · 2 · 2": "notification also invalidates the cached local-path fact,"
  "sourceChanged · 2 · 3": "including for authoritative open unsaved text. Recheck the"
  "sourceChanged · 2 · 4": "same retained snapshot if its effective scope ownership"
  "sourceChanged · 2 · 5": "changed; do not replace that text with saved bytes. Include"
  "sourceChanged · 2 · 6": "actually queried ownership URIs in dependencies so the"
  "sourceChanged · 2 · 7": "existing native watch boundary can invalidate them."
  "sourceChanged · 2 · 8": "Unrelated notifications cannot trigger a scan or reset"
  "sourceChanged · 2 · 9": "another document's facts."
}
