  "published · 1": "Receive current immutable DocumentAnalysis publications from"
  "published · 1 · 2": "the same live analysis, including replacements at the same"
  "published · 1 · 3": "editor version after dependency changes. Reject noninteger"
  "published · 1 · 4": "or negative versions with RangeError before changing state."
  "published · 1 · 5": "Prepare the current document's ordered declaration tree once"
  "published · 1 · 6": "from that report's public Inspection and exact captured"
  "published · 1 · 7": "source. This is authored structure, not a checked"
  "published · 1 · 8": "Specification or a claim that every reference resolves."
  "published · 1 · 9": "Independent compiler problems or deferred requirements do"
  "published · 1 · 10": "not suppress supported declarations. Rejected entry syntax"
  "published · 1 · 11": "or missing exact captured text withdraws the old outline."
  "published · 1 · 12": "Never parse, resolve, compile, discover files, read saved"
  "published · 1 · 13": "text or substitute an older accepted report here."
  "published · 2": "Include only source-authored component, concept, class,"
  "published · 2 · 2": "interface, record-type-declaration, alias-type-declaration,"
  "published · 2 · 3": "opaque-type-declaration, field, function and capability"
  "published · 2 · 4": "items belonging to this exact source URI. Names are the"
  "published · 2 · 5": "public decoded names; kind is exactly the listed language"
  "published · 2 · 6": "kind. Use each item's actual finite source origin and"
  "published · 2 · 7": "nameOrigin, requiring the nonempty name selection to be"
  "published · 2 · 8": "contained in the whole declaration and both ranges to fit"
  "published · 2 · 9": "the captured text. Preserve source order and actual public"
  "published · 2 · 10": "parent/children containment. Omit local wrappers while"
  "published · 2 · 11": "retaining their supported declarations beneath the nearest"
  "published · 2 · 12": "supported enclosing declaration. Do not emit import/public"
  "published · 2 · 13": "references, parameters, helpers, examples,"
  "published · 2 · 14": "scenario/interaction support, external or builtin nodes; do"
  "published · 2 · 15": "not promote declarations from excluded example/helper"
  "published · 2 · 16": "bodies. Do not infer nesting from spelling, references or"
  "published · 2 · 17": "dependencies. Imported declarations never become this"
  "published · 2 · 18": "document's outline."
  "published · 3": "Each emitted child's whole range must also be contained in"
  "published · 3 · 2": "its emitted parent's whole range. Omit an invalid supported"
  "published · 3 · 3": "declaration and its subtree rather than invent ranges or"
  "published · 3 · 4": "promote its children into a different parent."
