  "start · 1 · 10": "PROJECT-42 CliHost signal/stdout/stderr/asynchronous"
  "start · 1 · 11": "checkWrite. Forward actual root checks over owned plain IPC"
  "start · 1 · 12": "and map refusals to actual located Diagnostic values. Carry"
  "start · 1 · 13": "the actual child runtimeVersion separately from unchanged"
  "start · 1 · 14": "SDK JSON, including rejected versions. The SDK owns full"
  "start · 1 · 15": "entries, target order, preservation, journal recovery and"
