  "configurationChanged(configuration)": ""
  "Promises · configurationChanged": ""
  "configurationChanged · 1": "Receive an immutable captured saved configuration only for"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 2": "this controller's current connected selection, or absence"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 3": "when checking a different target, disconnected, deleting"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 4": "metadata, unavailable, invalid, unconfigured or disposed."
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 5": "This controls connection-owned work, independently of"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 6": "authored preview configuration. Absence cancels existing"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 7": "generation admission and clears queued save intents through"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 8": "the existing GenerationHost; it does not erase prior"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 9": "explicit per-manifest opt-in or discard terminal results and"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 10": "partial receipts. Receiving configuration is not a save"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 11": "intent and never starts generation. Preview and"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 12": "live-analysis consumers continue receiving the selected"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 13": "saved metadata through their existing independent boundary."
}
