  "present · 1 · 3": "or invalid. Target is the absolute logical configured or"
  "present · 1 · 4": "currently requested directory. verifiedDirectory is the"
  "present · 1 · 5": "actual canonical directory from the existing connector, only"
  "present · 1 · 6": "while connected. Connected establishes valid configuration"
  "present · 1 · 7": "and usable filesystem identity; it does not establish native"
  "present · 1 · 8": "build or dependency readiness. Disconnected means an"
  "present · 1 · 9": "explicit session-only suspension; saved metadata and target"
  "present · 1 · 10": "files remain intact."
