  "saveConfiguration · 1 · 4": "or write safety no longer match previous. Confirm success"
  "saveConfiguration · 1 · 5": "with the actual saved configurationChanged snapshot, or"
  "saveConfiguration · 1 · 6": "return this same previous object to saveFailed."
