  "observeWork · 1 · 4": "snapshot or absence. Replacing an observer withdraws the"
  "observeWork · 1 · 5": "previous observer first; disposal withdraws and releases it."
  "observeWork · 1 · 6": "Capture observer identity and controller revision around"
  "observeWork · 1 · 7": "every callback. Reentrant replacement, disconnect,"
  "observeWork · 1 · 8": "configuration changes or disposal cannot subsequently"
