  "observeWork · 1 · 11": "skip owned cleanup. The actual extension assembly attaches"
  "observeWork · 1 · 12": "its one existing GenerationHost through this operation,"
  "observeWork · 1 · 13": "rather than routing generation through preview feedback."
  # expec-uml: eyJmb3JtYXQiOjEsIm91dHB1dElkIjoidW1sIiwidmlldyI6InN0cnVjdHVyZSIsIm1lbWJlciI6IjYxYzljZjUyLWZmZTYtNGM4OS1hOWFkLWEwYjFjZTMzNTI2OSIsIm93bmVyIjoic18zZDM5NTljMzJjYTFhOTgzYjYwMmIzYmJjM2Y5ZDgzNjQ5ZTgwMDQwNzA1OWU0NzBmZjBiYWMwNDhiMjE3MmViIiwibmFtZSI6Imd1aWRhbmNlIiwicGFyYW1ldGVycyI6W119
  "guidance()": ""
  "Promises · guidance": ""
  "guidance · 1": "Return synchronous detached immutable facts prepared from"
  "guidance · 1 · 2": "the current captured saved snapshot and its already"
  "guidance · 1 · 3": "validated configuration. Missing metadata has"
  "guidance · 1 · 4": "requiresEntries true and hasProject false. Existing valid"
  "guidance · 1 · 5": "metadata keeps its build, has requiresEntries false and"
  "guidance · 1 · 6": "hasProject exactly when its validated project exists. A"
  "guidance · 1 · 7": "requested unsaved target is not saved project metadata."
  "guidance · 1 · 8": "Invalid metadata, no captured selection or a disposed"
  "guidance · 1 · 9": "lifetime returns absence. List configured outputs first in"
  "guidance · 1 · 10": "actual authored order with configured true and no"
  "guidance · 1 · 11": "suggestedDirectory, then eligible new typescript, uml and"
  "guidance · 1 · 12": "markdown IDs not already configured with configured false"
  "guidance · 1 · 13": "and suggestions '.', 'diagrams' and 'docs'. Suggestions are"
  "guidance · 1 · 14": "core-owned extension setup policy, not SDK defaults. Do not"
  "guidance · 1 · 15": "expose or reconstruct retained options; createConnection"
  "guidance · 1 · 16": "preserves their actual saved values. Return file, exact text"
  "guidance · 1 · 17": "or absence, and writable from the same captured snapshot,"
  "guidance · 1 · 18": "including dirty write safety. Caller mutation cannot alter"
  "guidance · 1 · 19": "earlier or future facts. Prepare facts when the saved"
  "guidance · 1 · 20": "configuration changes; this query performs no parsing,"
  "guidance · 1 · 21": "validation, connector work, reads, state publication,"
  "guidance · 1 · 22": "observer notification or persistence. It does not change"
  "guidance · 1 · 23": "session suspension or generation opt-in."
  # expec-uml: 
  "configurationChanged(snapshot)": ""
  "Promises · configurationChanged": ""
  "configurationChanged · 1": "Capture this exact saved text and write safety for one"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 2": "selected local manifest. Advance currentness before any"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 3": "asynchronous work and withdraw the old connected state while"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 4": "checking. Missing text is unconfigured. Validate existing"
