  "configurationChanged · 1 · 9": "manifest filename. A valid configuration without a project"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 10": "is unconfigured; an unavailable root is unavailable; only an"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 11": "actual connected result establishes connected and"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 12": "verifiedDirectory. Preserve logical target and canonical"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 13": "verified directory separately. An explicit disconnect"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 14": "remains suspended across saved changes to this same manifest"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 15": "and target events; selecting a different manifest starts its"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 16": "own unsuspended selection. Forward current active work only"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 17": "through the attached work observer, with absence before"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 18": "obsolete work can continue. Do not scan or capture a"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 19": "project, install packages, generate outputs or parse native"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 20": "project code. Only the latest configuration/target revision"
  "configurationChanged · 1 · 21": "may publish."
