  "chooseProject · 1 · 11": "missing manifest, propose formatVersion 1, version 0.1.0,"
  "chooseProject · 1 · 12": "build.entries [src/main.expec] and outputs []. This is this"
  "chooseProject · 1 · 13": "extension's explicit initial metadata setting, not a"
  "chooseProject · 1 · 14": "language default; connection does not check whether that"
  "chooseProject · 1 · 15": "source file exists, and authors must configure their actual"
  "chooseProject · 1 · 16": "build entry before compilation, with the selected root."
  "chooseProject · 1 · 17": "Never write the file itself or report the new project"
