  "createConnection · 1 · 12": "exact options; do not normalize, flatten or replace advanced"
  "createConnection · 1 · 13": "settings. A retained choice omits directory or supplies its"
  "createConnection · 1 · 14": "unchanged existing destination; a different destination"
