  "createConnection · 1 · 36": "verification, pending saves and connection-owned work before"
  "createConnection · 1 · 37": "accepting a new target. Request only manifest persistence"
  "createConnection · 1 · 38": "through feedback with the exact captured previous snapshot,"
  "createConnection · 1 · 39": "and remain checking until actual saved confirmation. A"
  "createConnection · 1 · 40": "successful explicit creation resumes this session's"
  "createConnection · 1 · 41": "selection. No target or authored-source writes."
