  "completion · 1 · 14": "each exact eligible spelling, the SDK's insertionText, and"
  "completion · 1 · 15": "its actual target's decoded name; aliases keep their"
  "completion · 1 · 16": "eligible spelling distinct from their target name. Empty"
  "completion · 1 · 17": "matching names may give a current reply with an empty list."
  "completion · 1 · 18": "Do not infer generic arguments, arity correctness, runtime"
  "completion · 1 · 19": "behavior or successful compilation. A request performs no"
  "completion · 1 · 20": "Inspection/query traversal, candidate query, parsing,"
  "completion · 1 · 21": "resolution, compilation, acquisition, generation, disk"
  "completion · 1 · 22": "writes or editor changes."
