  "hover · 1 · 2": "and zero-based Unicode-scalar offset. Reject noninteger or"
  "hover · 1 · 3": "negative versions/offsets with RangeError. Return absence"
  "hover · 1 · 4": "without a matching current report, after close/disposal,"
  "hover · 1 · 5": "outside the captured text or without Inspection. Select only"
