  "hover · 1 · 7": "source declaration's own authored name, when its half-open"
  "hover · 1 · 8": "range contains the cursor. Qualified prefixes, punctuation,"
  "hover · 1 · 9": "comments, unresolved, ambiguous or deferred references"
  "hover · 1 · 10": "return absence. The reply.source is the exact captured"
  "hover · 1 · 11": "requesting text, and reply offsets select that referring or"
  "hover · 1 · 12": "declaration name token. Read bound targets through the same"
  "hover · 1 · 13": "Inspection and require their exact captured source text;"
  "hover · 1 · 14": "source-free external targets, unsupported declarations or"
  "hover · 1 · 15": "unsafe/missing ranges return absence. A bound builtin"
  "hover · 1 · 16": "reference instead shows its exact SDK builtin name with an"
  "hover · 1 · 17": "empty description, without inventing source or an"
  "hover · 1 · 18": "implementation."
  "hover · 2": "For source capabilities, functions, setup/action/observation"
  "hover · 2 · 2": "helpers and checks, show the exact authored header from"
  "hover · 2 · 3": "origin.start to an available body's content.origin.start,"
  "hover · 2 · 4": "excluding its opening brace; when the body is absent use the"
  "hover · 2 · 5": "finite whole declaration origin. Remove trailing whitespace"
  "hover · 2 · 6": "only. The description contains only this callable's own"
  "hover · 2 · 7": "decoded promises.text members of its contract body in source"
