  "prepare · 1 · 3": "once with the exact URI/version. Reject fractional,"
  "prepare · 1 · 4": "negative, out-of-line and surrogate-splitting coordinates"
  "prepare · 1 · 5": "rather than clamp. Validate the returned whole authored"
  "prepare · 1 · 6": "token against this same captured requesting text before"
